// Demo catalog fixture data (pure data — no Prisma client, no I/O).
//
// Provenance:
//  - Domains, Skills and LevelRules mirror the historical inline seed rows of
//    `20261020_sprint2_domains_programs_assessment` (archived byte-exact under
//    prisma/migrations_archive/). The historical rows used literal non-CUID
//    identifiers and were embedded in a migration; this module carries the same
//    fictional *content* without any identifier — IDs are generated by Prisma
//    (@default(cuid())) at seed time, so every seeded row conforms to the
//    CUID validation enforced by the API validators.
//  - Demo programs and assessment questions are newly authored fictional
//    demo content (ASM-CAND-022: academic/demo system, fictional data only).
//    They exist to make the approved demo workflows (program listing,
//    application, assessment) exercisable on a fresh database.
//    The assessment question answer keys (correctOption) are SERVER-SIDE data
//    only: student-facing APIs strip them (NFR-DRV-001, verified in Phases 3/4).
//
// This file must never contain real persons, organizations, or credentials.

